<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Talk to VizAI</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Discuss a reviewed Snapshot, Infrastructure Build, or managed maintenance service with VizAI.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://vizai.io/contact">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Talk to VizAI">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Start with the smallest sensible next step for your business information infrastructure.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://vizai.io/contact">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://vizai.io/assets/vizai-redesign-og.png">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/redesign.css">
  <script is:inline>window.va = window.va || function () { (window.vaq = window.vaq || []).push(arguments); };</script>
  <script defer src="/_vercel/insights/script.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header"><div class="shell nav-shell"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="VizAI home"><span class="brand-sigil" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>VizAI</span></a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span></span></button><nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation" data-primary-nav><a href="/#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="/#services">Services</a><a href="/packages">Pricing</a><a href="/sample-report">Sample report</a><a href="/registry">Registry</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a class="button-secondary" href="/portal">Portal preview</a><a class="button" href="/scan">Run the free scan</a></div></div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Talk to VizAI</div><h1>Start with the outcome you need managed.</h1></div><div><p class="page-hero-copy">Tell us whether you need a diagnosis, a source-of-truth build, or ongoing maintenance. We will identify the smallest sensible next step and define the approval gates around it.</p></div></div></section>

    <section class="section compact">
      <div class="shell contact-grid">
        <aside class="contact-card highlight"><div class="panel-kicker">A useful first conversation</div><h3>You do not need to select or purchase a large service upfront.</h3><p>VizAI scopes the work around the evidence and remains accountable for the reviewed deliverable.</p><ul class="contact-points"><li>Free check while the question is directional</li><li>$495 Snapshot when human judgment is needed</li><li>Infrastructure Build after the source-of-truth facts are confirmed</li><li>Maintenance when approved facts require recurring care</li></ul><div class="button-row"><a class="button-secondary" href="mailto:hello@vizai.io">hello@vizai.io</a></div></aside>

        <form id="contactForm" class="form-card" action="https://formspree.io/f/mvzgdedo" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New VizAI Website Inquiry">
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="form-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="panel-kicker">Send a message</div>
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="field-group"><label for="contact-name">Name</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required></div>
              <div class="field-group"><label for="contact-email">Business email</label><input id="contact-email" name="_replyto" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field-group"><label for="contact-company">Business</label><input id="contact-company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company name and website"></div>
            <div class="field-group"><label for="contact-interest">What are you considering?</label><select id="contact-interest" name="interest" required><option value="">Select a service</option><option value="snapshot">Human-Reviewed Snapshot</option><option value="infrastructure-build">Infrastructure Build</option><option value="maintenance">Infrastructure Maintenance</option><option value="managed-improvement">Managed Improvement</option><option value="custom">Custom scope</option><option value="unsure">I am not sure yet</option></select></div>
            <div class="field-group"><label for="contact-message">What facts or representation issues are you seeing?</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" placeholder="A short description is enough." required></textarea></div>
            <button id="contactSubmit" class="button" type="submit">Send message</button>
            <p id="formStatus" class="form-note" role="status" aria-live="polite">Submitted securely through Formspree. VizAI normally responds within one business day.</p>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section tint"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head center"><div class="section-kicker">Before reaching out</div><h2 class="section-title">You may already have the right next step.</h2></div><div class="three-grid"><article class="info-card"><span class="card-icon">$0</span><h3>Still exploring?</h3><p>Run the free check for a directional baseline.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button-quiet" href="/scan">Run the check</a></div></article><article class="info-card"><span class="card-icon">$495</span><h3>Need human judgment?</h3><p>Review the sample Snapshot and its methodology.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button-quiet" href="/sample-report">See the report</a></div></article><article class="info-card"><span class="card-icon">Build</span><h3>Ready to scope work?</h3><p>Compare the included deliverables and boundaries first.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button-quiet" href="/packages">Review pricing</a></div></article></div></div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer" style="padding-top:80px;"><div class="shell"><div class="footer-grid"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-sigil" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>VizAI</span></a><p>Structured, verified business information—managed for an AI-mediated world.</p></div><div class="footer-column"><strong>Explore</strong><a href="/#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="/packages">Pricing</a><a href="/sample-report">Sample report</a></div><div class="footer-column"><strong>Product</strong><a href="/scan">Free scan</a><a href="/portal">Portal preview</a><a href="/registry">Registry</a></div><div class="footer-column"><strong>Company</strong><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="/#faq">FAQ</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 VizAI.</span><span>hello@vizai.io</span></div></div></footer>

  <script is:inline src="/scripts/redesign.js"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    const form = document.getElementById("contactForm");
    const submit = document.getElementById("contactSubmit");
    const status = document.getElementById("formStatus");

    form.addEventListener("submit", async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      submit.disabled = true;
      submit.textContent = "Sending…";
      status.textContent = "Sending your message securely…";

      try {
        const response = await fetch(form.action, {
          method: "POST",
          body: new FormData(form),
          headers: { Accept: "application/json" }
        });

        if (!response.ok) throw new Error("Submission failed");
        form.reset();
        status.textContent = "Thanks—your message was sent. VizAI will respond within one business day.";
      } catch (error) {
        status.innerHTML = 'The message could not be sent. Please email <a href="mailto:hello@vizai.io">hello@vizai.io</a>.';
      } finally {
        submit.disabled = false;
        submit.textContent = "Send message";
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
